<p> 1. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda	 one minute 49.374 seconds</p>
<p>(average speed 162.268 kmh, new lap record)</p>
<p> 2. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda	1:49.755</p>
<p> 3. Anthony Gobert (Australia) Suzuki     1:50.096</p>
